@startuml
title DID Registration Flow

actor Client
participant "Identity Service\n:8081" as Identity
participant "DidRegistry Contract" as Contract

Client -> Identity: POST /did/register\n{ did, publicKey }
Identity -> Contract: registerDid(did, publicKey)
Contract --> Identity: Transaction receipt (success)
Identity -> Contract: getDid(did)
Contract --> Identity: { publicKey, status=ACTIVE, timestamps, owner }
Identity --> Client: 201 Created\nDidDocument(status=ACTIVE)

@enduml
